<title>DENMARK: Oeresundsforbindelsen sets 350 mln DKK 4-pct bond.</title>
<headline>Oeresundsforbindelsen sets 350 mln DKK 4-pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Thursday by arrangers CIBC Wood Gundy and Nykredit Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - A/S OERESUNDSFORBINDELSEN</p>
<p>AMT - 350 MLN DANISH CROWNS</p>
<p>COUPON - FOUR PERCENT</p>
<p>MATURITY - 31 JANUARY 2005</p>
<p>ISS PRICE - TO BE ADVISED</p>
<p>ISS DATE - 29 JANUARY 1997</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - KINGDOM OF DENMARK</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
